   <dc:title>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">211203 Figure 1</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:title>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Figure 1. Process map of a typical patient journey during and after an ED attendance for a gout flare. Process steps are shown as rectangles; decision steps are shown as diamonds; ovals represent start/stop points. A high-level process map is shown at the top. Arrows depict flow between processes and decisions steps; dashed arrows highlight common sources of delay. See Supplementary Figure S1 for a detailed process map (available with the online version of this article). </rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
